text": "甜點的話人形町附近ease甜點（內用布丁超讚還有季節限定的各種蛋糕🫶🏻、SR coffee巴斯克跟苦焦糖拿鐵超級無敵好喝ㅜㅜ 、bank麵包可以一網打盡 還有很有人氣的小網神社也都在同一區", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZgysMTgT7-", "created_at": "2026-06-12 21:18:11", "error": null, "like_count": 6, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841466997783852", "author_name": "Adam Lu", "comment_id": "18429941221193885", "comment_text": "留", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZgxaaCk8pI", "created_at": "2026-06-12 21:07:01", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841427469422943", "author_name": "Meta AI", "comment_id": "18099419942159269", "comment_text": "原貼文已經看不到了，但其他人回覆都在推東京必吃。\n\n重點只有3個：有人說「只能吃一餐」會選那家分店超多的店，去東京幾乎天天吃；還有超商冰品，覺得台灣十年都做不出來；Shogun burger 也是每次去東京都要吃", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZgwmZygA8S", "created_at": "2026-06-12 20:59:55", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841472869175115", "author_name": "", "comment_id": "18127937833718384", "comment_text": "千萬不要到西新宿店吃...有生猛的蟑螂", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZgoUouCU4a", "created_at": "2026-06-12 19:47:35", "error": null, "like_count": 1, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841472869175115", "author_name": "", "comment_id": "18343797421169307", "comment_text": "見有留言推 但￼拜托！千萬不要到西新宿店！有生猛的蟑螂！！", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZgoPkjCcOz", "created_at": "2026-06-12 19:46:54", "error": null, "like_count": 25, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841469497658724", "author_name": "hydleo", "comment_id": "18113231956873194", "comment_text": "讚喔，有去秋葉原再去光顧", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZgllg5k1zu", "created_at": "2026-06-12 19:23:41", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933